  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></math> are in <math><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>, then <math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></math><br />i.e. the sum of two numbers is even<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Both numbers are even or odd<br />Odd numbers <math><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />(total <math><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> )<br />Even numbers <math><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2,4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></math><br />(total <math><mi>n</mi></math> )<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Required number of ways <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>441</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Sum of divisors <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math>",
